sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Pesquisador
    participant FE as Frontend (CancelJobButton)
    participant R as routes/jobs.py
    participant UC as usecases/job_cancel.py
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant JC as infra/job_control
    participant T as Thread do job
    participant W as Worker (grupo de processos)

    U->>FE: Clica em "Cancelar" e confirma
    FE->>R: POST /api/jobs/{kind}/{id}/cancel
    R->>UC: uc_cancelar_job()
    UC->>DB: valida dono e estado (pending ou running)
    alt Já terminou
        UC-->>FE: 409 Conflict
    else Cancelável
        UC->>DB: status = cancelled (commit)
        UC->>JC: cancel(kind, id)
        JC->>W: SIGTERM no grupo de processos
        Note over JC,W: Atinge o worker e os filhos<br/>(Chimera, Vina, Dock6...)
        JC->>W: SIGKILL após 5 s, se ainda vivo
        UC-->>FE: 200 {status: cancelled}
        W--xT: processo encerrado
        T->>JC: was_cancelled(kind, id)?
        T->>DB: marcar_erro é ignorado (status cancelled preservado)
        Note over T: Sem e-mail de falha
    end
    FE->>R: GET /{id} (polling)
    R-->>FE: status = cancelled
    FE->>FE: cartão "Processamento cancelado" + "Rodar novamente"
